Test-only trust anchor for scanner::test_tls::roots::system_roots_client_builds
(issue #510). A self-signed P-256 CA whose private key was discarded at
generation, so nothing can be signed under it: trusting it trusts nothing.
It exists only so a test can hand the platform verifier a non-empty
SSL_CERT_FILE without depending on the host's CA bundle.
